    "summary": "A pair of woman&#039;s socks; hand knitted (stocking stitch) with black and some blue wool from hand spun yarn.  Solid black toe.  Blue bands on black &#039;ground&#039; on foot and leg.  Save for two blue bands near top each blue band framed with a line of gold-coloured metal-wrapped thread embroidery (&#039;darned&#039;), though not extending to sole of sock.  Three rows of garter stitch at top.  Long ties made from plied black woollen thread.  Sock Eu2005,0704.3a has large hole on sole.",
